  "term": "customer relationship management",
  "definition": "Customer relationship management is an approach organizations use to shape their communications and promotional efforts to individuals based on information they have gathered about them. In this context, it refers to tailored incentive or support messages used by leisure and fitness centers to encourage ongoing physical activity.",
